We are to implement a warp-level reduction and online softmax for float16 data using __shfl_xor_sync.
 However, the user wants a self-contained C++17 implementation that compiles on host (g++ -std=c++17) without CUDA.
 We must simulate the warp-level operations and shared memory using C++17 threads or SIMD.

